  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/05/IMG_0697.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); line-height: 21.33333396911621px;\">La ma&ntilde;ana de este domingo se ha celebrado en la plaza de Espa&ntilde;a, en Onda, un nuevo mercado de intercambio, organizado por Ecoxarxa Plana Baixa. Despu&eacute;s estaba prevista una comida a pagar en ecos y una asamblea de la organizaci&oacute;n.</span></span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatintercanviecoxarcaplanabaixaonda180514/img_0686.jpg\" alt=\"img_0686\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatintercanviecoxarcaplanabaixaonda180514/img_0687.jpg\" alt=\"img_0687\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatintercanviecoxarcaplanabaixaonda180514/img_0688.jpg\" alt=\"img_0688\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatintercanviecoxarcaplanabaixaonda180514/img_0689.jpg\" alt=\"img_0689\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatintercanviecoxarcaplanabaixaonda180514/img_0690.jpg\" alt=\"img_0690\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatintercanviecoxarcaplanabaixaonda180514/img_0691.jpg\" alt=\"img_0691\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercatintercanviecoxarcaplanabaixaonda180514/img_0692.jpg\" alt=\"img_0692\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0